          "dense_rank": null,
          "lexical_score": 4.907004,
          "lexical_rank": 10,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# General practice services\n## Long-term conditions\n\nIf you live with a long-term condition such as type 2 diabetes, high blood pressure, asthma or COPD, your GP will agree a regular review schedule w",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 606,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": null,
          "dense_rank": null,
          "lexical_score": 4.3775163,
          "lexical_rank": 12,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n## Recording a consultation\n\nYou may make an audio recording of your own consultation for your personal use, as long as you tell the practitioner before you ",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 601,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": null,
          "dense_rank": null,
          "lexical_score": 3.8202791,
          "lexical_rank": 13,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Preparing for tests at the clinic\n## Spirometry (breathing test)\n\nSpirometry measures how much air you can breathe out, and how fast. You will blow hard into a mouthpiece several times while sitting",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 600,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": null,
          "dense_rank": null,
          "lexical_score": 3.6913738,
          "lexical_rank": 15,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Dental care guide\n## Before your appointment\n\nTell the dentist before any treatment if you take a blood-thinning medicine such as warfarin, apixaban (Eliquis) or clopidogrel (Plavix), or if you have",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 604,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": null,
          "dense_rank": null,
          "lexical_score": 3.495995,
          "lexical_rank": 17,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Email\n\nWe use email only to confirm a new appointment and to send an itemized receipt you have asked for. We do not send test results or medical",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 602,
